  "title": "Reveal / Line",
  "text": "\u25e9 REVEAL / LINE\nTACTICAL EDITION\n\u26f6\nMissions\nCollection\nSettings\nREVEALED\n0.0%\nTARGET 45%\nLIVES\n\u25c6 \u25c6 \u25c6\nTIME\n0:00\nSCORE\n00000\n\nMISSION 01\n\nClear a path.\nReveal a world.\n\nLeave safe ground, draw a line and return.\nReveal 45% by enclosing regions without a field enemy.\n\nStandard difficulty.\n\nStart mission \u2197\nLearn by playing\nMission brief\nMain menu\n\nTap a direction to fly. Equipment controls are in How to play. Esc / P pauses.\n\nReady for launch\nClose a line to reveal the picture\n\nYour first route: fly down from the marked start to the opposite border.\n\nFPV FIELD KIT / FLIGHT READY\n\nREVEAL\n/ LINE\nDeploy\n\u2192\nMissions\nCollection\nSettings\nWorkshop\nRelease explorer\nPlay another edition\n\nDeploy \u00b7 Pressure Lines / Arcade\n\nChoose a flight. Trace a path. Close the line.\n\nVERSION V0.52.0\n\nHANGAR 01\nFIRST LIGHT",
